---
import DemoLayout from '../../../components/demos/DemoLayout.astro';
import Art from '../../../components/demos/Art.astro';
import Comparison from '../../../components/demos/Comparison.astro';
import LocalEnquiry from '../../../components/demos/LocalEnquiry.astro';
const projects=[['Courtyards','A room without a roof','landscape-one'],['Water & planting','A softer edge','landscape-two'],['Courtyards','Room to grow','landscape-three']];
---
<DemoLayout slug="landscape-outdoor">
  <section class="demo-hero d-shell"><div class="hero-copy"><div><p class="d-kicker">Landscape & outdoor living / Fictional studio</p><h1>Make room<br />for the outdoors.</h1></div><div><p class="d-lead">A place to gather. A quieter corner. An outdoor space that belongs to the way you live.</p><a class="d-text-button" href="#work">Explore the garden studies ↓</a></div></div><div class="hero-media"><Art name="landscape-hero" alt="AI-generated concept image of a planted courtyard with a pergola, paving and outdoor table" eager sizes="100vw" /><p class="art-caption">The courtyard study / AI-generated concept image, not a completed project</p></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell" id="work"><div class="d-section-head"><div><p class="d-kicker">01 / Places to imagine</p><h2>Small moments.<br />Considered spaces.</h2></div><p>Three generated studies explore outdoor living. These are fictional concepts, not built projects or client work.</p></div><div data-filter-gallery><div class="filter-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Filter garden concepts">{['all','Courtyards','Water & planting'].map((c,i)=><button type="button" data-gallery-filter={c} aria-pressed={i===0?'true':'false'}>{c==='all'?'All studies':c}</button>)}</div><div class="gallery-cards">{projects.map(([c,t,a])=><figure data-gallery-item={c}><Art name={a} alt={`Original fictional garden study: ${t}`} /><figcaption>{t}<span>{c} · Concept study</span></figcaption></figure>)}</div><p class="gallery-count" data-gallery-count role="status">3 concepts shown</p></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell" id="services"><p class="d-kicker">02 / A considered approach</p><h2>From first idea<br />to a clearer direction.</h2>{[['Garden planning','A layout that considers movement, gathering spaces and the relationship between the house and garden.'],['Planting direction','A visual approach to texture, scale and seasonal character. Real species selection would require site-specific assessment.'],['Outdoor living','A framework for seating, shade and practical connections between spaces. Materials and construction would be confirmed separately.']].map(([t,p],i)=><article class="landscape-service"><span class="d-index">0{i+1}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></article>)}</section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell"><div class="d-grid-2"><Comparison id="garden-comparison" before="landscape-four" after="landscape-one" beforeAlt="AI-generated concept image of a sparse courtyard before the concept planting and furniture" afterAlt="Same fictional courtyard with a pergola, seating and planting" /><div><p class="d-kicker">03 / A different way to see the space</p><h2>See the possibility.</h2><p class="d-lead">Move the slider to reveal a planted courtyard concept over an open site study.</p><p>This comparison is an AI-generated concept of a design idea. It does not document a real build, transformation or promised result.</p><p class="demo-note">Keyboard: focus the slider and use the arrow keys to change the view.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell" id="process"><p class="d-kicker">04 / The design conversation</p><h2>A garden starts with listening.</h2><ol class="d-steps"><li><h3>Understand</h3><p>Discuss how the space is used, what matters and the practical constraints.</p></li><li><h3>Explore</h3><p>Develop an initial direction for layout, materials and atmosphere.</p></li><li><h3>Refine</h3><p>Review the concept together and agree the details that need further work.</p></li><li><h3>Plan ahead</h3><p>Clarify documentation, specialists and the next stage before proceeding.</p></li></ol></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell"><div class="d-grid-2"><div><p class="d-kicker">05 / Service areas concept</p><h2>Right for the site.<br />Right for the scope.</h2></div><div><p class="d-lead">Courtyards. Residential gardens. Outdoor living spaces.</p><p>A real landscape business would list its verified service region and explain where on-site visits or remote consultations are available.</p><p class="demo-note">Fieldwork is a fictional studio. No actual service area, construction licence or project availability is claimed.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell"><LocalEnquiry id="quote" title="Tell us what you imagine." kind="project brief" date={false} options={['A courtyard concept','A garden planning concept','An outdoor living concept','A planting direction']} /></section>
</DemoLayout>
